TEXT 96 24 Left 2 ;Two-stage CMOS amplifier - DB HiTek 3.3V / TT / L=1um
TEXT 96 688 Left 2 ;STARTING SIZES, NOT OPTIMIZED. M7 uses two parallel devices; effective width = 2*W7.
TEXT 96 720 Left 2 ;Bulk assumption: all PMOS wells to VDDA, all NMOS bodies to ground. CL=10p fixed.
TEXT 96 960 Left 2 !.param VSUPPLY=3.3 VCM={VSUPPLY/2} LCH=1u RZERO=1k CCOMP=2.2p CLOAD=10p
TEXT 96 1000 Left 2 !.param W12=40u W34=40u W5=40u W6=80u W7=80u W8=20u W9=5u W10=5u
TEXT 96 1040 Left 2 !.lib "models/1533IL11SK_Rev3p0.l" tt_33
TEXT 96 1080 Left 2 !.op
TEXT 96 1120 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 0.01 1G
TEXT 96 1160 Left 2 !.temp 25
TEXT 96 1200 Left 2 ;Differential gain: V(vout)/(V(vin2)-V(vin1)). VIN2 is non-inverting; VIN1 is inverting.
